-- =====================================================================
-- NAP-IQ Sample / Dummy Data
-- For local development and testing only. No real customer information
-- is used here — all names, addresses, and numbers are fictional.
--
-- Regenerated: one NAP per barangay for all 26 barangays of Sta. Cruz,
-- Laguna (Alipit, Bagumbayan, Bubukal, Calios, Duhat, Gatid, Jasaan,
-- Labuin, Malinao, Oogong, Pagsawitan, Palasan, Patimbao, Poblacion I-V,
-- San Jose, San Juan, San Pablo Norte/Sur, Santisima Cruz, Santo Angel
-- Central/Norte/Sur). Each NAP has 1-3 randomly generated connected
-- subscribers and 1-2 randomly generated reported technical issues, each
-- issue pinned at its subscriber's *exact* coordinates (required by the
-- Report Issue "pin must match the subscriber's exact location" rule).
-- Generated by database/gen_seed.py with random.seed(42) for reproducibility.
--
-- Usage (MySQL command line, after schema.sql has been run):
--   mysql -u root -p nap_iq < database/seed.sql
-- =====================================================================

USE nap_iq;

