-- hashes (Phase 7), generated for these DEMO passwords only —
-- change them (or delete these seed rows) before any real deployment:
--   admin1      / Admin@12345
--   tech1       / Tech@12345
--   tech2       / Tech@12345
--   collector1  / Collect@12345
--   customer1   / User@12345

